{
  "abstract": "{\"capability_summary\":\"获取当前巨量引擎工作台下的资产账户列表（客户，企业号），如果巨量引擎工作台下还有子级组织账号，会把cc_account_id下所有可操作的资产账户全量返回。Token支持不同角色用户授权生成，某些无全量权限的角色仅能看到当前巨量引擎工作台账户id下有权限操作的账户列表。操作权限受授权账号影响。关键配合接口有【获取已授权账户】。\",\"id\":\"customer_center.advertiser.list\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/customer_center/advertiser/list/\",\"method\":\"GET\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1696710520884224\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"get.access_token\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"需要先获取Access token才能调用本接口\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"},{\"id\":\"get.authorized_account\",\"path\":\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710506574848\",\"reason\":\"需要先获取已授权账户的cc_account_id才能调用本接口\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取已授权账户\"}],\"risk_level\":\"low\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1696710520884224\",\"supplemental_knowledge\":[],\"title\":\"获取旧版巨量引擎工作台下账户列表\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-R3VqFvrk\">获取当前巨量引擎工作台下的资产账户列表（客户，企业号），如果巨量引擎工作台下还有子级组织账号，会把cc_account_id下所有可操作的资产账户全量返回</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-zDvdpfGK\">Token支持不同角色用户授权生成，某些无全量权限的角色（ 巨量引擎工作台(协作者) ）仅能看到当前巨量引擎工作台账户id下有权限操作的账户列表。操作权限受授权账号影响，所以可能会出现相同的工作台帐号在不同access_token请求下获取的列表不同的情况。</p>\n<div class=\"qz-api-metadata\" data-type=\"apimetadata\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22interfaceId%22%3A%201762938488247296%2C%20%22docLibId%22%3A%201743864733602830%7D\">\n \n</div>\n<h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-P91WSPcI\" id=\"h6f20189-7cLEcZaF\">请求地址</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-fmo3md5j\"><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/customer_center/advertiser/list/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"blank\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">https://ad.oceanengine.com/open_api/2/customer_center/advertiser/list/</span></a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/tools/visual_debug.html?docId=1696710520884224\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">可视化调试</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1773083358100557\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">SDK下载</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" style=\"font-size: 12px;color: #fff; display: inline-block; padding: 2px 8px;border-radius: 4px;background: #2a55e5;margin-left: 8px; color: #fff !important;\" target=\"_blank\">MCP调用</a></p><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-KiRFaKLD\" id=\"h6f20189-18dQdJDe\">请求方法</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-kj0rY7Pb\">GET</p><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-n2PDgISj\" id=\"item-link-Header\">Header</h3><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table cl